WEBVTT

00:00:21.733 --> 00:00:22.993
<v><b>A:</b></v> You’re up early today.

00:00:23.462 --> 00:00:25.503
<v><b>B:</b></v> Actually, I’m late.

00:00:37.129 --> 00:00:38.330
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thanks for coming this evening.

00:00:38.921 --> 00:00:39.707
<v><b>B:</b></v> No problem.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.416
<v><b>A:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

00:00:53.613 --> 00:00:54.492
<v><b>B:</b></v> Don’t worry, Ben.

00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:56.006
We haven’t ordered yet.

00:01:07.554 --> 00:01:09.805
<v><b>A:</b></v> People always need coffee.

00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:13.369
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, I guess you’re right.

00:01:24.907 --> 00:01:26.020
<v><b>A:</b></v> How was your evening?

00:01:26.707 --> 00:01:28.428
<v><b>B:</b></v> I didn’t enjoy it much.